        },
        {
          "text": " Ŋul kes odwe luka Lebi kwape ajaatar ikekia luka lukapapaakec, kes ikapolok luka ikekia luka lukapapaa luka ŋul kaluaponi kimarakinitete, kotiai loka ikiroria, kakwesikec, lueswamaete aswam naka aiiaanakin naka etogo loka EJAKAIT, ageun kaluka ikar akaisaarei ka adepar da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
