          "text": " Naka imugatin luka aitodikin, ka akiria nuidicic nuka ainakinet naka akiria, arai nuka imugatin luebenen lumam itubuunitoi, arai lupeon, arai luipoo, kaiponesio kere luka aitem ka luka etiai; ",
