        },
        {
          "text": " Ainakin ainakineta nuieweio kere mama ejai EJAKAIT, kanuka asabaton, napilamununei elap, kopucin lueseunitai, kotiai kwape kejaar aicorakinetekec, tiritir kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT: ",
